  "claim_id": "C042",
  "obligation_id": "C042-B-1",
  "contract": "LIMIT_WARRANT",
  "subject": "An internal-range exception alone does not establish food-safety status.",
  "verdict": "SATISFIED",
  "unresolved_conditions": [],
  "rationale": "T001 specifies an internal receiving range without establishing its relationship to food-safety criteria. A single package reading, differing receiving methods, and incomplete temperature histories do not supply that missing relationship. The exception alone therefore warrants neither a safe nor an unsafe classification; this limitation does not suspend existing food-handling requirements.",
